{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M6diS8raLvP1TdGjwXz2QT","type":"tool_result","content":"/**\n * @file The engine in a page (PLAN.md §6.4, §6.9, §8.3, WP 2.7): `createEngine({ canvas, scenes, levels })` registers\n * the levels the page imported as text, reads the page's routes (engine/app/routes.ts: `?scene ?seed ?cam ?replay`,\n * settings by path, a gallery link `#gallery/<kind>/<id>` with its driver, engine/dev/galleryShoot.ts), starts the\n * scene as a recorded run with its view (engine/app/headless.ts, engine/app/view.ts), publishes the run's inspector\n108-  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;\n110-  scenes: readonly string[];\n115-  levels?: Readonly<Record<string, { text: string; file?: string; materials?: Readonly<Record<string, string>> }>>;\n117-  replays?: Readonly<Record<string, () => Promise<string>>>;\n119-  search?: string;\n121-  hash?: string;\n123-  registry?: Registry;\n125-  log?: Log;\n127-  touchLayout?: string;\n132-  actionMap?: string | ((camera: string) => string);\n134-  onView?: (action: string) => void;\n136-  onMenu?: () => void;\n138-  onFrame?: (frame: EngineFrame) => void;\n140-  store?: Store;\n142-  modal?: () => boolean;\n144-  cameraInput?: () => CameraInput | undefined;\n150-  readonly inspector: Inspector | null;\n152-  readonly ready: boolean;\n154-  readonly routes: Routes | null;\n156-  readonly ui: Overlay | null;\n158-  readonly input: Input | null;\n165-  playback?: Playback;\n166-  error?: unknown;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"5d660cf3-1ba8-4276-aeea-52254816e868","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:24:10.696Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/**\n * @file The engine in a page (PLAN.md §6.4, §6.9, §8.3, WP 2.7): `createEngine({ canvas, scenes, levels })` registers\n * the levels the page imported as text, reads the page's routes (engine/app/routes.ts: `?scene ?seed ?cam ?replay`,\n * settings by path, a gallery link `#ga