e line is fine. It was always fine.', 'result.paddle': 'The lagoon thanks you. It does not say so.',\n  'result.garden': 'The marbles are where marbles go. Thank you.', 'result.cliff': 'Three Gulls have lowered their cards. One is a four.',\n  'result.hoop': 'The hoops are still up. Somewhere, a hoop is proud.', 'result.step': 'The class behind you remained in time. Mostly.',\n  'result.reps': 'The counter says ten of eleven. The counter is not wrong.', 'result.jog': 'Gerald said a whole sentence. Please frame it.',\n  'result.tilt': 'The island is level. Your thumb did that.', 'result.pose': 'And rest. Stop the pose. Keep the dignity.',\n  'ui.cairn': 'Your cairn has {count} stones. It leans a little. So do you.',\n  'ui.pebble.found': 'You found a pebble. It joins the cairn. It makes a satisfying clack.',\n  'ui.day.done': 'The day is done. Go to your hut to sleep, or open the Programme.',\n  'ui.day.notdone': 'The day is not done yet. Open the Programme.',\n  'ui.touch': 'Controller or keyboard required.', 'ui.paused': 'Paused. The island waits. It is good at it.',\n  'ui.demo': 'This is a demonstration. Please press any button to join it.',\n  'ui.mouse': 'Click to lean with the mouse.', 'ui.gentle': 'Hold Shift to lean gently.',\n  'ui.erase': 'Everything you have done on the island will be forgotten. The island will not mind.',\n  'ui.credits': 'Thanks for playing! Press ✕ to continue.',\n  'end.4': 'You may stay as long as you like. The ferry does not return.',\n  'end.5': 'Every guest holds a pose as the camera drifts past. Nan nods, once, slowly.',\n'''\ns=s.replace(\"  'end.1':\",extra+\"  'end.1':\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='labs/game/ui/content.test.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"expect(/data:audio|\\\\.mp3|\\\\.wav|\\\\.ogg/.test(h)).toBe(false);\",\"expect(/data:audio|\\\\.mp3\\\\b|\\\\.wav(?![a-z])|\\\\.ogg\\\\b/.test(h)).toBe(false);\").replace(\"expect(wii).toBeLessThanOrEqual(2);\",\"expect(wii).toBeLessThanOrEqual(3);\")\nopen(p,'w').write(