{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjqXvnhwZVQWbjyw8iLJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M5ETzJzzEorixmHxD1vhkQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -i \"s/a flat drum torso, a dial, stubby legs, no arms/a flat drum torso, a dial, short legs, no arms/; s/on two stubby legs/on two short legs/\" labs/game/art/bodies.ts && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='labs/game/scenes/events/rules.test.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.rstrip()\nassert s.endswith(\"});\")\ns=s[:-3]+'''  it('a run continues exactly after a capture and a restore', async () => {\n    const { lite } = await import('../../tools/testkit');\n    const run = (h: Awaited<ReturnType<typeof lite>>, n: string, a?: object) => (h.actions as unknown as { run(n: string, a?: object): void }).run(n, a);\n    const h = await lite(8); run(h, 'game.start', { event: 'hoop' }); run(h, 'game.bot', { kind: 'human' }); h.step(300);\n    const cap = h.capture(); h.step(600); const straight = h.hash();\n    h.restore(cap); h.step(600); expect(h.hash()).toBe(straight);\n  }, 300000);\n});\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='labs/game/ui/about-data.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"    'unknown until the final run: see the chat reply',\\n    'unknown until the final run: see the chat reply',\\n    'The four stand-in players\",\"    'Sixteen: a terrain rebuilt on every call (650 ms a step), a register past its array (a data error that surfaced at capture), a custom input action silently overridden each frame, a missed button edge, the hub card not answering Enter before the view existed, ready() called too late under load, an idle Still Pond scoring 748 instead of 500, a too-easy Line, a mis-measured Hoop spin, a Cliff spin that was too slow, a Garden bot that lagged worse than the sloppy one, a Tilt bot that never led anyone east, Escape both closing a menu and opening pause, and the lint and file-length caps.',\\n    'Seven: the terrain rebuild, the register overflow, the overridden input map, the missed button edge, the hub card and the late ready() (two), and a Tilt bot that could not finish the finale.',\\n    'The four stand-in players\")\ns=s.replace(\"'The four stand-in players (perfect, human-like, sloppy, idle) run against every activity: they found the unwinnable and the trivial ones within one run.'\",\"'The four stand-in players (perfect, human-like, sloppy, idle) on every activity, and the scripted whole-game playthrough: they found unwinnable and trivial activities and a data error the first time they ran.'\")\ns=s.replace(\"'The pixel-level screenshots: the headless GPU is software-rendered, so they only confirmed that something was drawn.'\",\"'The screenshots: the software-rendered GPU takes seconds a frame, so a shot before the first frame is solid black, and they told me little a script could not.'\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Sixteen\" labs/game/ui/about-data.ts | head -2; npx prettier --write labs/game >/dev/null 2>&1; npm run check 2>&1 | tail -4","timeout":400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":269,"cache_read_input_tokens":620497,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":269},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"67119fbd-3f00-46be-b67a-a1e57725a20c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:11:30.639Z","request_id":"req_011CgjqXvVqf7P9syj6Gca5u","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01M5ETzJzzEorixmHxD1vhkQ":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-031600__x54facc/work/WellWobbled-WiiFit-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261105-031600 && sed -i \"s/a flat drum torso, a dial, stubby legs, no arms/a flat