{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgjy24JVJFifTCrALGkrg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final build is done in as far as this machine allows, but the stop hook's condition isn't fully met, and I can't honestly say it is.\n\n**Added this round**\n- Golden replays: two attract-loop replays are now in `labs/game/replays/`. `node x replay` reports both match their goldens in Node (×3). I did not run the Chromium side (`--browser sim`) because the browser keeps crashing here.\n- Expert variants: a Settings option raises sway 35% in every activity. It unlocks at 10 pebbles, and the Dev Mode slider panel is unchanged.\n- Plumb's eyes now read as closed: the eye colour matches the skin, so no open eye dots are drawn.\n- The cairn already stacked and leaned with your last Wobble Age, so that item was done before; it just wasn't in my earlier list.\n- `npm run check` passes and the content, wobble and audio tests pass. I did not re-run the activity balance tests or the whole-game playthrough after these edits. The single HTML is rebuilt.\n\n**Still not done**\n- **Browser stage:** every attempt on the final build crashes with \"Target crashed\". The shared machine has about 4 GB free, other agents' browsers are running, and earlyoom kills mine. The controller, keyboard, 10-foot text, attract, touch-only, About and no-WebGPU checks therefore have no clean pass on this build. They passed 18 of 20 on an earlier build.\n- **Screens not looked at:** I haven't looked at the Programme, pond, line, results, pause, Dev Mode or About screens.\n- **Plan features I did not build:**\n  - the Gull and Frog as characters,\n  - Plumb's swinging plait,\n  - the headband and the 20/30-pebble tracksuit colours (Expert, at 10 pebbles, is done).\n- **Hub harness:** it passes at 2, 3, 4 players and with the host leaving when run on its own, but flaked under load in the last full run.\n\nThese need a quiet machine or more work than I can do here. I'd rather say so than claim the build is complete."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":536,"cache_read_input_tokens":660703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":536},"output_tokens":684,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"8ad2151d-f588-4b4c-9e4e-3b9c9e34da01","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:49:32.706Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjy23tgfwKegvYE64J9g"}
