{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk4EKqZ4gnscFsxiFReU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The headband and tracksuit colours are now built, but the browser stage still can't complete, so the stop condition is still not met.\n\n**New this round**\n- **Tracksuits:** lilac unlocks at 20 pebbles, and gold with a coral headband unlocks at 30. They sit in Settings → Play under \"Tracksuit\", next to mint, coral, sky and slate. Choosing one calls a new `game.look` action that swaps the guest's body and puts the guest back at the plaza. The same call runs again when you begin.\n- **Tests:** a test that changes the tracksuit and then plays Still Ring to its results passes.\n- **Checks:** `npm run check` passes, and `app.ts` is 595 lines, under the 600 cap. The new test and the island test pass; I did not re-run the other test files after this change.\n- **Build:** the single HTML is rebuilt.\n\n**Not verified**\n- **Browser stage:** it crashes again with \"Target crashed\", with about 2.9 GB of memory free and other agents' browsers running.\n- **Not seen working in a browser:** the Programme, pond, line, results, pause and Dev Mode screens on the final build, and the new Tracksuit row and unlock gating.\n- **Still not built:** nothing else from the plan that I know of is missing, apart from the Gull and Frog having no talk prompts or behaviour.\n\nThe deliverables are all in `work/`: the single HTML, `exit-interview.json` and the dev folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":685790,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":369},"output_tokens":484,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-