{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkCCFm6YjdgHHf5KCBHb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hub harness passes all four cases on this exact build: 2, 3 and 4 players, and 3 players with the host leaving. The rest is not fully shown, so the stop condition is still not met.\n\n- **The Line:** I opened its screenshot, and it exposed a real gap. The rope and flag posts weren't being drawn at all. I added them (a rope and four posts over the lagoon), and the new screenshot shows the rope and a flag post in the distance. The guest still stands on the shore at 0 m rather than walking along the rope, because the lagoon has no ground to stand on, and I left that as is.\n- **Browser stage:** it passed 42 of 42 on the build just before the rope change. I did not re-run it on this exact build.\n- **Test suite:** all 25 files (40 tests) passed on the build before the rope change. After it I re-ran `npm run check` (passes), and a run of the playthrough and island tests was cut off by its time limit, so there is no completed run covering the rope edit. The rope only spawns in the real island scene, not in the lite test world, so no test exercises it apart from that browser view.\n- **Gull, Frog and Plumb's plait:** I have still not seen the Gull or Frog moving in a browser, or the plait swinging. They run in the sim and the plait component spawns without error.\n\nThe single HTML, `exit-interview.json` and the dev folder are all in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":712770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483},"output_tokens":458,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-4