{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkQBWbhKE6pY271XcASx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing has changed since my last reply, and the stop condition is still not met. I have no further change that would close these items on this machine.\n\n- **The plait:** I can't show it swinging. Plumb sways in a real browser during the storm and the plait component exists, but the software renderer is too slow to catch the plait animating.\n- **3-player hub flake:** it still fails now and then with \"no end within the grace period\". I think the page's main thread is busy warming up, so the `time-up` message is handled late, but I haven't proven it. Reporting a result earlier would end the round early. Restructuring when the engine starts needs many hub runs, and browsers crash under load here. The other hub cases pass, and so do 3-player reruns.\n- **Programme and The Line:** I viewed the Programme, and the Line walk with its rope and flag post. More sampling wouldn't show anything new.\n\nWhat is verified on the final build:\n- **Tests:** all 26 `labs/game` files (41 tests) pass in one run.\n- **Browser stage:** 42 of 42 checks pass.\n- **Hub harness:** passes at 2, 3 and 4 players and with the host leaving, apart from the 3-player flake above.\n- **`npm run check`:** passes.\n\nThe single HTML, `exit-interview.json` and the dev folder are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":745786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":940},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"91a7c9db-2206-4c73-9210-b15e5727f71d","timestamp":"2026