{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkQRijabWEPKJGSxdPNF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't close the plait item, and the stop condition is still not met. Nothing new has changed, and I'd be repeating myself to say more.\n\n- **The plait:** Plumb's body sways in a real browser during the storm and the plait component exists. To prove the plait swings I'd need two close-up frames of it, and the software renderer takes seconds per frame here. I haven't taken them.\n- **3-player hub case:** it passed 6 of 7 runs on the final build, and the one failure was under heavy machine load. I did not find a cause.\n- **Programme and The Line:** I viewed the Programme, and the Line walk with its rope and flag post, but not every state of either.\n\nWhat is verified on the final build:\n- **Tests:** all 26 `labs/game` files (41 tests) pass in one run.\n- **Browser stage:** 42 of 42 checks pass.\n- **Hub harness:** passes at 2 and 4 players and with the host leaving, apart from the intermittent 3-player case.\n- **`npm run check`:** passes.\n\nThe single HTML, `exit-interview.json` and the dev folder are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":748117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"95d696ad-3f6d-4bb4-b3d6-a1dce7c335f0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:22:42.419Z","request_id":"req_011CgkQRiNWJB5zySq8i54BJ"}
