{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkQS9qx134tQbrjWPrNv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop condition is still not met, and I can't change that from here.\n\n- **The plait:** I can't prove it swings. Plumb's body sways in a real browser during the storm and the plait component exists. To show the plait itself I'd have to point a camera at Plumb during the storm. The storm only runs when the guest is at the plaza, far from Plumb's pavilion. On top of that, the software renderer takes seconds per frame. I haven't built that camera shot.\n- **3-player hub case:** it passed 6 of 7 runs on the final build, and the one failure was under heavy machine load. I did not find the cause.\n- **Programme and The Line:** I viewed the Programme, and the Line walk with its rope and flag post, but not every state of either.\n\nWhat is verified on the final build:\n- **Tests:** all 26 `labs/game` files (41 tests) pass in one run.\n- **Browser stage:** 42 of 42 checks pass.\n- **Hub harness:** passes at 2 and 4 players and with the host leaving, apart from the intermittent 3-player case.\n- **`npm run check`:** passes.\n\nThe single HTML, `exit-interview.json` and the dev folder are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":748683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":745},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83c655a-6d0a-42b2-ac8e-79c6fd4e6b22","uuid":"977b781d-1b07-47c7-b8c8-a5fece6a29d4","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:22:49.329Z","request_id":"req_011CgkQS9YqeKSwhuG9DRuyB"}
